#: e9ccc6378d1d4b0db433f8fa2dc13e16
msgid "ArduPilot includes a suite of Pre-arm Safety Checks which will prevent the vehicle from arming its propulsion system if any of a fairly large number of issues are discovered before movement including missed calibration, configuration or bad sensor data. These checks help prevent crashes or fly-aways but some can also be disabled if necessary."
msgstr ""

