#: c97b22002b8840caa58670b049c4c12b
msgid "**Check Board Voltage**: the board's internal voltage is below 4.3 Volts or above 5.8 Volts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:341
#: 01de6f9c54a24e7abc03bccd99cf1908
msgid "If powered through a USB cable (i.e. while on the bench) this can be caused by the desktop computer being unable to provide sufficient current to the autopilot - try replacing the USB cable."
msgstr ""

