msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:424
#: 31b6fb7103f545e6b43cd664b05b0e0f
msgid "Arming checks can be individually skipped by setting the :ref:`ARMING_SKIPCHK<ARMING_SKIPCHK>` parameter to something other than 0. For example, setting to 4 skips the checks that the GPS has lock. In extremely unusual circumstances, setting the parameter to -1 can be used to skip all current and future pre-arm checks (though mandatory checks still remain)."
msgstr ""
